                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ikawa huyo Boazi alipokwisha kula na kunywa, na moyo wake umekunjuka, alikwenda kulala penye mwisho wa rundo la nafaka; na huyo mwanamke akaja taratibu, akaifunua miguu yake, akajilaza papo hapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ikawa usiku wa manane yule mtu akashtuka, akajigeuza; na kumbe! Yupo mwanamke amelala miguuni pake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
